        "TileImage": "$($repository 0771273c-2ea6-4d2b-a636-409925f626c9).Image",
        "Description": "SquidwardBobi cruised along the ocean roads, letting the gentle currents guide him. His favorite music played softly as he watched the colorful reefs pass by. For once, there was nowhere he needed to be and nothing he had to prove.\r\rAs he drove through the quiet evening, he smiled at the peaceful view. But when he looked at the empty seat beside him, a small sadness returned. He kept driving, enjoying the journey while carrying a few memories along the way.",
